OL,3,GNEWSATravis Perkins dip in sales blamed
OL,4,Aon 'uncertainty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA building materials supplier has
OL,7,Freported falling sales as it warns of
OL,8,Feconomic uncertainty in the industry.
OL,10,FNorthampton-based Travis Perkins said
OL,11,Flike-for-like revenue fell by 1.3% in
OL,12,Fthe three months to 30 September.
OL,14,FIn the year to the end of September,
OL,15,Fthe group's like-for-like revenue
OL,16,Fdropped by 0.9%.
OL,18,FThe group said the industry remained
OL,19,Fsubdued, especially in the new build
OL,20,Fresidential sector, "as macroeconomic
OL,21,Funcertainty persists".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
